  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Thermocombustion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d6/Leonard_Burns_Voltage_Nova.webp/revision/latest?cb=20221123172514\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Leonard Burns Voltage Nova\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d6/Leonard_Burns_Voltage_Nova.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20221123172514\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d6/Leonard_Burns_Voltage_Nova.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20221123172514 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d6/Leonard_Burns_Voltage_Nova.webp/revision/latest?cb=20221123172514 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Leonard Burns Voltage Nova\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Leonard_Burns_Voltage_Nova.webp\" data-image-name=\"Leonard Burns Voltage Nova.webp\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Leonard Burns (Fire Force) can convert the heat he radiates from himself with Voltage Nova into fire.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb heat and convert it to combustion.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>convert heat into fire</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Combustion\" title=\"Energetic Combustion\">Energetic Combustion</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Powers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Powers</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermocombustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Heat-Fire Conversion</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermocombustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can convert heat into fire-based elements, and manipulate them however they please. The subject can either be transformed completely, partially, permanently or temporarily depending on what level of power the user has, with some users being able to induce and reverse the effect at will.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermocombustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Conversion\" title=\"Heat Conversion\">Heat Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Fire Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Fire Manipulation\">Fire Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Heat Manipulation\">Heat Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Ionization\" title=\"Thermal Ionization\">Thermal Ionization</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Energizing\" title=\"Heat Energizing\">Heat Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Absorption\" title=\"Heat Absorption\">Heat Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Combustion\" title=\"Self-Combustion\">Self-Combustion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermocombustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alien_Physiology\" title=\"Alien Physiology\">Alien Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Ambient Energy Conversion\">Ambient Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Generation\" title=\"Fire Generation\">Fire Generation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermocombustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much heat user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers, <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Manipulation\" title=\"Ice Manipulation\">Ice Manipulation</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Manipulation\" title=\"Cold Manipulation\">Cold Manipulation</a> can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in extremely cold environments, especially with a lack of energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermocombustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://avatar.fandom.com/wiki/Firebending\">Firebenders</a> (<i>Avatar: The Last Airbender/The Legend of Korra</i>)</li>\n<li>Nuova Shenron (<i>Dragon Ball GT</i>)</li>\n<li>Charon (<i>Fire Force</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/c:fireforce:Leonard_Burns\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"community:c:fireforce:Leonard Burns\">Leonard Burns</a> (<i>Fire Force</i>)</li>\n<li>Fuego (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Sunfire (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://needless.fandom.com/wiki/Aruka_Schild\">Aruka Schild</a> (<i>Needless</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Powers\">Known Powers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermocombustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://avatar.fandom.com/wiki/Firebending#Special_techniques\">Firebending</a> (<i>Avatar: The Last Airbender</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/c:fireforce:Voltage_Nova\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"community:c:fireforce:Voltage Nova\">Voltage Nova</a> (<i>Fire Force</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://needless.fandom.com/wiki/Agnis_Schiwattas\">Agnis Schiwattas</a> (<i>Needless</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260801173920\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 111/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 141/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.175      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    7.175      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:507812-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260801173920 and revision id 2759665. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
